From: N0zoM1z0 <161784452+N0zoM1z0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 21:54:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [th02/main] Stones: decompile the rest of the stage 3 boss

pillar_add() takes an int patnum: its callers push the duration and patnum
constants as one PUSH imm32. The [5] stone kill frame array ends in the word
ReC98 called word_1EB26.
---
 th02/main/boss/boss.hpp   |   2 +
 th02/main/boss/stones.cpp | 422 ++++++++++++++++-
 th02/main/pillar.cpp      |   2 +-
 th02_main.asm             | 964 +-------------------------------------
 4 files changed, 435 insertions(+), 955 deletions(-)

diff --git a/th02/main/boss/boss.hpp b/th02/main/boss/boss.hpp
index 9671c7ae..9c5ec89c 100644
--- a/th02/main/boss/boss.hpp
+++ b/th02/main/boss/boss.hpp
